    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5540" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπρ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw along, drag,</i>
			E.ap.Phot.<i><span class="en">
				p.95
			</span></i> R.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰχμάλωτον ἤμπρευσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
