					<u>Fr.</u>
					234
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυπρὸν βίον ἀμπρεύσει</span>
			<i>will drag on</i> a wretched life, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				975
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				635
			</span></i>.</div>
